## Suggested information architecture

```
/                  → Hero + 3–4 sample profile cards + 1 CTA
/explore           → Searchable index (filter by field, country, age-at-record)
/p/[slug]          → Profile card (the dossier)
/about             → "What is F18?" content
/standard          → "How the record-breaking standard works"
/nominate          → Tip form (formerly "Get Featured")
```

